# Trivy ignore file — accepted vulnerabilities with rationale.
#
# POLICY: These are all in `next` 14.2.35, which is the NEWEST release in the
# 14.x line — so there is NO patch available within our current major version.
# Every fix below lands only in Next.js 15.x. We have chosen to mitigate now
# (see next.config.js image-optimizer hardening) and schedule the 14 -> 15.5.x
# major upgrade as a separate, fully-tested effort. The CI Trivy step is
# informational (exit-code: 0), so these never block a deploy.
#
# REMOVE this whole file once Next.js is upgraded to >= 15.5.16.
# Last reviewed: 2026-06-06

